      "Cost per 25 g": "About $3.12 (Amazon price seen, $34.99)"
    },
    "amazonUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F4K1XF3"
  },
  {
    "id": "isopure-clear-protein-powder-review-isopure-clear-sticks-electrolytes",
