            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary><h3>Does Isopure Clear contain caffeine?</h3></summary>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  The fruit flavors do not list any caffeine or tea. The tea flavors are different: the Raspberry Island Tea label lists instant tea and states it contains less than 60 mg of naturally occurring caffeine per serving. Strawberry Peach Tea is likely similar, but check its label. Anyone pregnant or sensitive to caffeine should stick to the fruit flavors.
                </p>
