                  Citrus Lemonade and Tropical Punch are the flavors buyers mention most often, and they are the ones Isopure keeps in the largest 1.98 lb tub. Pineapple Orange Banana also gets steady praise. This is buyer feedback, not our tasting. If you are unsure, buy a 14-serving pouch of one flavor before committing to the big tub.
