                  Foam after shaking is the top complaint, followed by a faint protein or milky aftertaste and, for some buyers, a noticeable stevia sweetness. Price is the other common gripe, since clear wheys cost more per gram than creamy powders. Isopure says its newer formula has less foam, and letting the drink settle for a minute helps most buyers.
